TI  - The Threat Posed by Commercial First-Person View (FPV) Unmanned Aerial Vehicles (UAVs) Modified by Asymmetrical Warfare Actors
PY  - 2025
T2  - The Co-evolution of Technology and Warfare: Reshaping the Battlefield
SP  - 41
EP  - 55
