TI  - Western fantasy and tropical nightmare: Spectacular architecture and urban warfare in Rio
PY  - 2022
T2  - The Routledge Handbook of Architecture, Urban Space and Politics, Volume I: Violence, Spectacle and Data
SP  - 379
EP  - 394
DO  - 10.4324/9781003112464-29
